  "headline_finding": {
    "claim_tested": "Agent plan quality collapses as dependency depth grows, and the cause is context-window truncation.",
    "verdict": "BOTH HALVES FALSIFIED. Quality did fall with depth (r = -0.59), but truncation explains none of it, and the real cause was the FORMAT of the tool's own output.",
